<title>USA: Burlington Coat ups shr buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Burlington Coat ups shr buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Coat Factory Warehouse Corp said on Wednesday that it increased its stock program by authorizing an additional $5 million to repurchase common stock.</p>
<p>The company extended the duration of the program through January 1, 1999.</p>
<p>Burlington Coat has repurchased 516,000 shares of its common stock, $1 par value, under the program.</p>
<p>Shares were trading up 1/4 at 11-3/4 at midday.</p>
<p>	 -- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
